  "scope": "WebView package-resource security boundary, ephemeral WebKit session lifecycle, per-session capability-bound input.read, navigation policy, actual WebKit provenance checks, isolated-world reply delivery, and bounded replay state. The bridge has closed methods, bounded envelopes and payloads, replay rejection, main-frame and webView/origin/session checks, exact version-pinned source and markdown reads, and an isolated-world postMessage relay. It adds no trusted activation, general subresource interception, network harness, storage, safe mode, SwiftUI host, Excalidraw, JSON Canvas, or settings UI.",
